LICENSE NOTICE — MIMIK
=======================

MIMIK is a Linux port of mimic (https://github.com/littledivy/mimic),
written by Divy Srivastava and released under the MIT License. The core
capture/extraction/session code (extract, session, sources/mitm,
sources/har, and parts of the CLI and codegen prompt) is derived from that
project. New MIMIK work — the persistent capture store, the deterministic
$0 generator, the Linux file launchers, the Wine-prefix capture target,
the Qt GUI, and the installer — builds on it.

